     5405559.515995919
    ],
    "content": {
     "contentMode": "map",
     "title": "Step 2 · CSIC-IFCA Santander – Atlas inputs",
     "markdown": "🔵 **ONLINE** – published, link only (not re-hosted here)\n\n* Hosts the WGI **Interactive Atlas** and, with DKRZ, the DDC long-term archive for input and intermediate data.\n* Same observational and CMIP6 inputs, aggregated **regionally**.\n* Figure 2.1 is global, so no Atlas product feeds it directly.\n* Useful for regional versions of panels (c) and (d).\n\n[interactive-atlas.[ipcc.ch](https://ipcc.ch)](https://interactive-atlas.[ipcc.ch](https://ipcc.ch))\n\n➡ **Next** – Mauna Loa, where the CO₂ record starts.",
     "image": ""
    },
    "layerOverride": [],
    "transition": {
     "type": "smooth",
     "time": 2.0
    }
   }
  },
