     "title": "Step 3 · DKRZ Hamburg – IPCC-DDC_AR6_Supplements",
     "markdown": "🟡 **PARTIAL** – exists but incomplete or not verifiable from here\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| **Project** | `IPCC-DDC_AR6_Supplements` – intermediate datasets with DDC quality assurance |\n| **Examples** | assessed GSAT projections (doi:[10.26050/WDCC/AR6.IPCC-DDC_AR6_Sup_GSATPr](https://doi.org/10.26050/WDCC/AR6.IPCC-DDC_AR6_Sup_GSATPr)) · sea-level projection distributions |\n| **Figure 2.1 entry** | none found; SPM.1 / SPM.2 ensemble statistics were archived with the *final* data at CEDA |\n| **Open item** | the *Find data* list is JavaScript-only; browse it manually and note GMST / attribution entries |\n| **Link** | [wdc-climate.de → IPCC-DDC_AR6_Supplements](https://www.[wdc-climate.de/ui/project?acronym=IPCC-DDC_AR6_Supplements](https://wdc-climate.de/ui/project?acronym=IPCC-DDC_AR6_Supplements)) |\n\n➡ **Next** – CEDA, where the chapter-level chain is published.",
