    "content": {
     "contentMode": "markdown",
     "title": "Step 4 · Final data – overview",
     "markdown": "## Step 4 · The numbers plotted in Figure 2.1\n\n| Panel | Working-Group record (final data) |\n|---|---|\n| **(a)** | 🟢 WGIII *Data for Figure SPM.1* · [10.48490/vfxm-tm28](https://doi.org/10.48490/vfxm-tm28) · IPCC Data Catalogue · rebuilt here from the Zenodo source |\n| **(b)** | 🟢 WGI Ch.2 *Data for Figure 2.5* v20221116 · [10.5285/c6f19b27…](https://doi.org/10.5285/c6f19b27f8e74e98968c17c8e1f74c60) · CEDA |\n| **(c)** | 🟢 WGI *Data for Figure SPM.1* v20221116 · [10.5285/0b275905…](https://doi.org/10.5285/0b2759059ad6474098e40dad73e0a8ec) · CEDA |\n| **(d)** | 🟢 WGI *Data for Figure SPM.2* v20210809 · [10.5285/c1eb6dad…](https://doi.org/10.5285/c1eb6dad1598427f8f9f3eae346ece2f) · CEDA |\n\n| Panel | SYR-level record (CIESIN / SEDAC) |\n|---|---|\n| **(a)**, **(b)** | 🔴 no SYR record |\n| **(c)** | 🟡 *SYR LR Figure 2.1 (c)* · [10.7927/nq55-cr83](https://doi.org/10.7927/nq55-cr83) · Excel, browser-only |\n| **(d)** | 🟡 *SYR LR Figure 2.1 (d)* · [10.7927/b38b-zp83](https://doi.org/10.7927/b38b-zp83) (verify) · Excel, browser-only |\n\nCEDA's *IPCC AR6 Synthesis Report (SYR)* collection record exists but is still **not published** (2026-10-13).\n\n➡ **Next** – CEDA, the IPCC Data Catalogue, CIESIN.",
