    "content": {
     "contentMode": "map",
     "title": "Step 4 · CEDA Harwell – WGI final data (panels b, c, d)",
     "markdown": "🟢 **AVAILABLE** – copy in this project, loaded live from the archive when online\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| **SPM.1 v20221116** | panel (c) · `SPM1_1850-2020_obs.csv`, `SPM1_1-2000_recon.csv`, `spm1_6500_recon.csv`, `gmst_changes_model_and_obs.csv` · doi [10.5285/0b275905…](https://doi.org/10.5285/0b2759059ad6474098e40dad73e0a8ec) |\n| **SPM.2 v20210809** | panel (d) · `SPM2a.csv` (observed 1.06 [0.88–1.21] °C), `SPM2b.csv` (human 1.07 [0.8–1.3]), `SPM2c_data.csv` (CO₂ 0.79, CH₄ 0.51, N₂O 0.09 °C) · doi [10.5285/c1eb6dad…](https://doi.org/10.5285/c1eb6dad1598427f8f9f3eae346ece2f) |\n| **Ch.2 Fig 2.5 v20221116** | panel (b) · `Data_Figure_2.5.csv` – 30 columns, 5 networks · doi [10.5285/c6f19b27…](https://doi.org/10.5285/c6f19b27f8e74e98968c17c8e1f74c60) |\n| **Format** | BADC-CSV: metadata header → `data` → rows → `end_data` |\n| **Licence** | CC BY 4.0 · cite dataset DOI **and** report component |\n| **Checked** | 2026-10-13: catalogue reachable, bundled copies identical to the archive |\n\n➡ **Next** – the WGIII record for panel (a).",
