     27231036.833157476
    ],
    "content": {
     "contentMode": "markdown",
     "title": "Step 4 · IPCC Data Catalogue – WGIII final data (panel a)",
     "markdown": "## Step 4 · WGIII *Data for Figure SPM.1*\n\n🟢 **AVAILABLE** – copy in this project, loaded live from the archive when online (rebuilt from the open source workbook)\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| **Record** | *Data for Figure SPM.1*, version 0.0.1, 4 April 2022, Lamb et al. |\n| **DOI** | [10.48490/vfxm-tm28](https://doi.org/10.48490/vfxm-tm28) → [ipcc-browser.ipcc-data.org/browser/dataset?id=437](https://ipcc-browser.ipcc-data.org/browser/dataset?id=437) |\n| **Content** | global net anthropogenic GHG emissions 1990–2019, Gt CO₂-eq (GWP100), by gas |\n| **Access** | CSV in the *Data Downloads* section – JavaScript application, browser only |\n| **Source** | Minx et al. (2021) ESSD · Zenodo [10.5281/zenodo.6483002](https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.6483002) |\n| **In project** | `data/final/wgiii_spm1/global_ghg_emissions_by_gas_1970-2019.csv` – 1990: 38.3 · 2010: 52.6 · **2019: 59.1 Gt** |\n\nOpen item: download the official CSV in a browser and store it next to the rebuilt file for a one-to-one check.\n\n➡ **Next** – CIESIN / SEDAC, the SYR host.",
