    "extent": [
     -8260275.688132955,
     4991312.024424727,
     -8195416.718891919,
     5034551.337252083
    ],
    "content": {
     "contentMode": "map",
     "title": "Step 4 · CIESIN / SEDAC – SYR final data (panels c, d)",
     "markdown": "🟡 **PARTIAL** – exists but incomplete or not verifiable from here\n\nSYR figure data are catalogued in the IPCC Data Catalogue and hosted by CIESIN / NASA SEDAC (Columbia University).\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| **Panel (c)** | *SYR LR Figure 2.1 (c): Changes in global surface temperature* · id 8498 · v1.0.0 (2025-04-10) · doi [10.7927/nq55-cr83](https://doi.org/10.7927/nq55-cr83) · Excel ~15 KB |\n| **Panel (d)** | *SYR LR Figure 2.1 (d): Humans are responsible* · id 8493 · v1.0.0 (2025-04-09) · doi [10.7927/b38b-zp83](https://doi.org/10.7927/b38b-zp83) – verify on landing page |\n| **Panels (a), (b)** | 🔴 no SYR-level record – use WGIII SPM.1 / WGI Fig 2.5 |\n| **Access** | [sedac.ciesin.columbia.edu/ddc/ar6-syr-lr-fig2-1c/](https://sedac.ciesin.columbia.edu/ddc/ar6-syr-lr-fig2-1c/) · [sedac.ciesin.columbia.edu/ddc/ar6-syr-lr-fig2-1d/](https://sedac.ciesin.columbia.edu/ddc/ar6-syr-lr-fig2-1d/) – browser only |\n| **Open item** | download both workbooks, confirm DOI and licence, save as CSV in `data/final/syr_fig2_1/` |\n\n➡ **Next** – the status dashboard.",
     "image": ""
    },
